## Quick Test

### Q1

_____ in 1990, the building is one of the oldest in the city.

(A) Constructing
(B) Constructed
(C) Construct
(D) Construction

### Q2

_____ the instructions carefully, she completed the task without difficulty.

(A) Reading
(B) Read
(C) Reads
(D) To read

### Q3

_____ by the unexpected news, the employees immediately contacted the manager.

(A) Surprising
(B) Surprise
(C) Surprised
(D) Surprises

### Answers

1. **B — Constructed**
2. **A — Reading**
3. **C — Surprised**

### 오늘의 한 줄 정리

> **직접 행동 → -ing**
>
> **행동을 당함 → p.p.**
